OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 14, held as police probe
OL,4,A'mindless vandalism'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of criminal damage by police
OL,8,Finvestigating "mindless vandalism" the
OL,9,Fnight before Halloween.
OL,11,FAbout 20 people are said to have
OL,12,Ftargeted vehicles in the Asda car park
OL,13,Fand in Hey Road in Huyton, Merseyside,
OL,14,Fat about 20:00 GMT on 30 October.
OL,16,FCCTV shared on social media showed more
OL,17,Fthan a dozen males dressed in black,
OL,18,Fwith some stamping through the windows
OL,19,Fof parked cars.
OL,21,FMerseyside Police said it was an "an
OL,22,Fappalling act of criminal damage".
